    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="21">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 21</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ si ælc wuduwe þe hi silfe mid rihte healde on Godes griðe ⁊ on ðæs cynges.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And all widows who lead a respectable life shall enjoy the special protection of God and of the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ si ælc wydewe, þe hy sylfe mid rihte gehealde, on Godes griðe ⁊ on þæs cynges.</ab>
      </div>
